			"notes": "# Scaffold v1.1.0 - Changelog\n\n## 🛠 Fixes\n- Fixed many rendering bugs  \n- **Scaffolding no longer crashes servers! 🎉**\n\n## ✨ New Features\n- Added **Mesh Platform**\n- Added **Gold Mesh Platform**  \n  _You can only pass through when holding the item set by the filter._\n- Added **8 Stone Brick Platforms**:\n  - Basalt  \n  - Clay  \n  - Granite  \n  - Limestone  \n  - Marble  \n  - Polished Stone  \n  - Stone  \n  - Slate\n\n## 🔁 Gameplay Changes\n- Jumping from below a platform now boosts you up to ensure you land on its surface"
		},
